## 1. Definitions

"Software" means the source code, documentation, configuration, prompts,
schemas, and any other files in this repository, together with any derivative
work of them.

"You" means the person or entity exercising rights under this license.

"Individual" means a natural person acting on their own behalf. An Individual
is not a company, partnership, nonprofit, government body, university,
foundation, association, or any other legal entity, and is not a natural person
acting for or on behalf of one.

"Personal Purpose" means use by an Individual for their own study, learning,
hobby projects, private experimentation, or evaluation, where the use does not
generate revenue and does not support the operations, products, services,
research, or internal tooling of any legal entity.

"Commercial Purpose" means any use that is intended for or directed toward
commercial advantage or monetary compensation, and any use by or for a legal
entity, whether or not that entity is for-profit.

"AI System" means a machine learning model, foundation model, language model,
agent, or other automated system that learns statistical patterns from data,
along with the software that trains, fine-tunes, distills, evaluates against, or
serves such a system.

## 2. Grant

Subject to every condition and limitation below, you are granted a worldwide,
royalty-free, non-exclusive, non-sublicensable, revocable license to use, copy,
modify, and create derivative works of the Software, and to distribute those
derivative works, but only if you are an Individual and only for a Personal
Purpose.

## 3. Prohibited uses

You may not do any of the following without a separate written license from the
copyright holder.

**3.1 No commercial or organizational use.** You may not use the Software for a
Commercial Purpose. You may not use it as, or as part of, an employee,
contractor, consultant, or volunteer of any legal entity, or on behalf of any
legal entity, including internal tooling, research, evaluation, benchmarking,
consulting work, or a hosted service.

**3.2 No AI training.** You may not use the Software, or any part of it, as
training data, fine-tuning data, distillation data, evaluation data, or
retrieval corpus for any AI System. You may not include it in a dataset intended
or reasonably likely to be used for any of those purposes.

**3.3 No AI-driven use.** You may not operate the Software as a component,
backend, tool, or evaluation harness of an AI System offered to any third party,
and you may not permit an AI System to use the Software to produce output for a
third party.

**3.4 No relicensing.** You may not distribute the Software or a derivative work
under different terms, and you may not remove or alter this license, the
copyright notices, or the notices required by section 4.

